        "rationale": "The proposed edit correctly reflects the statutory qualification in subparagraph (B). While subparagraph (A) requires consumer reporting agencies described in both section 1681a(p) and (w) to make free annual disclosures upon request, subparagraph (B) limits the application of subparagraph (A) for section 1681a(p) agencies specifically to requests made using the centralized source established under section 211(c) of the Fair and Accurate Credit Transactions Act of 2003.",
